-full/page-0738/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆「從」字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0738/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书「從」字演变形体之一\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0738/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书「從」字演变形体之二\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0738/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"晋代「從」字异体，加辵旁\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0738/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g015\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文「并」字，二人相并连结\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0738/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g016\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆「并」字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0738/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g017\", \"description\": \"战国文字「并」字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0738/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g018\", \"description\": \"秦代金文/简帛「并」字之一\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0738/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g019\", \"description\": \"秦代金文/简帛「并」字之二\", \"kind\": \"h