{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_18","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"evidence\":[{\"source\":\"李學勤主編《字源》, 2012; direct inspection of PDF p. 737, printed p. 724, scan /home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0737/source.png. Google Books confirms the publication metadata only.\",\"field\":\"匕部; 匕 headword, forms, and account\",\"text\":\"The headword 匕 has a sequence labeled Shang, Western Zhou, Warring States, Qin, Shuowen small seal, and regular script. The entry calls 匕 a pictograph of an ancient shallow, long-handled food scoop with a somewhat pointed end, and cites Duan Yucai’s identification with a rice spoon. This is the book’s account of 匕 as a character in its own right; it does not independently establish that the early 比 graph contains 匕.\",\"record_character\":\"匕\",\"kind\":\"locally_inspected_scholarly_book\",\"url\":\"https://books.google.com/books/about/%E5%AD%97%E6%BA%90.html?id=xqP9zAEACAAJ\",\"title\":\"字源, Volume 3 — Google Books bibliographic record\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"李學勤主編《字源》, 2012; direct inspection of PDF p. 738, printed p. 725, scan /home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0738/source.png. Decoded RGB source_pixel_sha256: 0b480d227be9f6681c790466aa93265d111e3255ae8f93feb0442c3291abd1e2. Google Books confirms publication metadata only.\",\"field\":\"比部; 比 headword and glyph sequence\",\"text\":\"The printed headword is 比. Its sequence labels Shang, Western Zhou, Shuowen ancient form, Qin, Shuowen small seal, Han, and regular script. The accompanying account says the main sequence retains a two-匕 construction from Shang–Zhou through small seal, with an exception among the ancient forms, and says clerical transformation straightened the strokes and obscured their pictorial quality. These are 董莲池’s analyses, not an independently settled account of the early graphs.\",\"record_character\":\"比\",\"kind\":\"locally_inspected_scholarly_book\",\"url\":\"https://books.google.com/books/about/%E5%AD%97%E6%BA%90.html?id=xqP9zAEACAAJ\",\"title\":\"字源, Volume 3 — Google Books bibliographic record\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"李學勤主編《字源》, 2012; direct inspection of PDF p. 738, printed p. 725, scan /home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0738/source.png. Decoded RGB source_pixel_sha256: 0b480d227be9f6681c790466aa93265d111e3255ae8f93feb0442c3291abd1e2. Google Books confirms publication metadata only.\",\"field\":\"比部; 董莲池’s formation, component-role, and semantic proposals\",\"text\":\"The entry proposes an ideographic construction from two 匕 signs, described as ancient shallow, long-handled food scoops. It says placing the two signs in parallel conveys adjacency or nearness and explicitly says 匕 also cues the pronunciation. It accepts the sense of Shuowen’s gloss 密也 while rejecting Shuowen’s analysis as two 人 forms reversed from 从. It proposes semantic extensions from nearness to union, factional association, and comparison. These are attributed proposals, not independently established formation or semantic chronology.\",\"record_character\":\"比\",\"kind\":\"locally_inspected_scholarly_book\",\"url\":\"https://books.google.com/books/about/%E5%AD%97%E6%BA%90.html?id=xqP9zAEACAAJ\",\"title\":\"字源, Volume 3 — Google Books bibliographic record\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"李學勤主編《字源》, 2012; direct inspection of PDF p. 738, printed p. 725, scan /home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0738/source.png. Decoded RGB source_pixel_sha256: 0b480d227be9f6681c790466aa93265d111e3255ae8f93feb0442c3291abd1e2. Google Books confirms publication metadata only.\",\"field\":\"比部; cited examples and proposed senses\",\"text\":\"The entry cites 《詩·周頌·良耜》其比如栉 for its adjacency sense; an oracle-bone phrase 王比望乘伐下危 for union; 《論語·為政》君子周而不比 for factional association; and 《左傳·昭公二十八年》 for comparison. This records the author’s interpretation and examples; it does not establish a dated chain of semantic development or independently verify the oracle-bone graph.\",\"record_character\":\"比\",\"kind\":\"locally_inspected_scholarly_book\",\"url\":\"https://books.google.com/books/about/%E5%AD%97%E6%BA%90.html?id=xqP9zAEACAAJ\",\"title\":\"字源, Volume 3 — Google Books bibliographic record\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"Baxter and Sagart, Old Chinese reconstruction table, version 1.1 (13 September 2014), direct inspection of the official table PDF. The 匕 entry is on table p. 15; the 比 entries are on table p. 70.\",\"field\":\"匕; Middle Chinese and Old Chinese entries\",\"text\":\"The table lists 匕 bǐ as MC pjijX and OC *pijʔ, with glosses “ladle, spoon” and “spoon” (GSR 0565a and 0566a). These are reconstructions and historical-source transcriptions, not direct ancient recordings; their similarity to one 比 reading does not prove a component role.\",\"record_character\":\"匕\",\"kind\":\"primary_reconstruction_table\",\"url\":\"https://sites.lsa.umich.edu/ocbaxtersagart/wp-content/uploads/sites/1415/2025/03/BaxterSagartOCbyRadStr2014-09-20.pdf\",\"title\":\"Baxter-Sagart Old Chinese reconstruction, version 1.1 (13 September 2014)\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"Baxter and Sagart, Old Chinese reconstruction table, version 1.1 (13 September 2014), direct inspection of the official table PDF. The 比 entries are on table p. 70.\",\"field\":\"比; distinct Middle Chinese and Old Chinese entries\",\"text\":\"The table lists 比 bǐ, MC pjijX, OC *C.pijʔ, gloss “compare,” and separately 比 bì, MC pjijH, OC *pij-s, gloss “combine; all” (GSR 0566g). Relative to 匕 *pijʔ in the same system, the bǐ entry shares rhyme and coda but has the additional onset notation *C-. Similarity alone does not establish that 匕 functions as a phonetic component in 比.\",\"record_character\":\"比\",\"kind\":\"primary_reconstruction_table\",\"url\":\"https://sites.lsa.umich.edu/ocbaxtersagart/wp-content/uploads/sites/1415/2025/03/BaxterSagartOCbyRadStr2014-09-20.pdf\",\"title\":\"Baxter-Sagart Old Chinese reconstruction, version 1.1 (13 September 2014)\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"Taiwan Ministry of Education, Dictionary of Chinese Character Variants, entry A02102\",\"field\":\"說文釋形; historical dictionary account and modern readings\",\"text\":\"The entry reproduces Shuowen’s account: 密也。二人為从，反从為比, and lists modern Mandarin readings bì, bǐ, and pí. This confirms the transmitted historical dictionary analysis and reading inventory; it does not independently demonstrate the early graph’s composition.\",\"record_character\":\"比\",\"kind\":\"official_dictionary_record\",\"url\":\"https://dict.variants.moe.edu.tw/dictView.jsp?ID=23088&la=1\",\"title\":\"[A02102] 比 — Ministry of Education Dictionary of Chinese Character Variants\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"漢語多功能字庫, Chinese University of Hong Kong, 比 entry\",\"field\":\"形義源流通解; competing graph analysis and early uses\",\"text\":\"The entry analyzes oracle-bone and bronze 比 as two 人 forms placed side by side and distinguishes 比 from 从 by the figures’ usual orientation and 比’s more curved lower part, attributing the distinction to 屈萬里. It also reports oracle-bone readings as 妣 and an “assist/support” interpretation of 王比望乘 attributed to 李宗焜. This account conflicts with 字源’s two-匕 proposal; the page reports scholarly interpretations rather than independently resolving the graph identity.\",\"record_character\":\"比\",\"kind\":\"scholarly_dictionary_entry\",\"url\":\"https://humanum.arts.cuhk.edu.hk/Lexis/lexi-mf/search.php?word=%E6%AF%94\",\"title\":\"漢語多功能字庫 — 比\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"李宗焜, “卜辭中的「望乘」——兼釋「比」的辭意,” 《古文字與古代史》第一輯 (2007), p. 117; Academia Sinica abstract\",\"field\":\"Early Shang phrase 王比望乘; competing lexical interpretations\",\"text\":\"The abstract reports earlier readings of 比 in 王比望乘 as “follow” or “lead,” and an alliance reading. Li argues instead for “assist/support,” potentially by gathering people and materials for a campaign. This substantiates disagreement over the phrase’s interpretation, not a settled general semantic history for 比.\",\"record_character\":\"比\",\"kind\":\"scholarly_article_abstract\",\"url\":\"https://www1.ihp.sinica.edu.tw/storage/publishBookItem/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E8%BC%AF_06%E6%9D%8E%E5%AE%97%E7%84%9C_%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81.pdf\",\"title\":\"卜辭中的「望乘」——兼釋「比」的辭意\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"Unicode Unihan official per-character endpoint; direct open attempted for 比, 匕, and 人\",\"field\":\"kMandarin; official reading verification attempt\",\"text\":\"The official pages for U+6BD4, U+5315, and U+4EBA could not be accessed through the browser in this session. No current Mandarin comparison is asserted from those pages.\",\"record_character\":\"比; 匕; 人\",\"kind\":\"official_dictionary_access_attempt\",\"url\":\"https://www.unicode.org/cgi-bin/GetUnihanData.pl?codepoint=6BD4\",\"title\":\"Unicode Unihan record for 比 (U+6BD4)\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"}],\"search_audit\":[{\"query\":\"比 字源 甲骨文 两匕 两人 说文 屈万里 古文字 学术\",\"urls\":[\"https://dict.variants.moe.edu.tw/dictView.jsp?ID=23088&la=1\",\"https://ephpth.ephhk.com/resource/tools/lcprichi/search/show_word.php?id=1426\",\"https://humanum.arts.cuhk.edu.hk/Lexis/lexi-mf/search.php?word=%E6%AF%94\"],\"outcome\":\"Search located the Ministry dictionary and educational and university character entries. Opened the Ministry and CUHK entries and inspected their text; the HK Education Bureau result was not reopened in this invocation.\"},{\"query\":\"比 甲骨文 王比望乘 李宗焜 卜辞 比 辅助 联盟 释义\",\"urls\":[\"https://www1.ihp.sinica.edu.tw/storage/publishBookItem/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E8%BC%AF_06%E6%9D%8E%E5%AE%97%E7%84%9C_%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81.pdf\"],\"outcome\":\"Opened and inspected the Academia Sinica abstract, which explicitly reports competing readings and Li’s assist/support proposal.\"},{\"query\":\"site:sites.lsa.umich.edu/ocbaxtersagart 比 匕 Baxter Sagart Old Chinese\",\"urls\":[\"https://sites.lsa.umich.edu/ocbaxtersagart/\",\"https://sites.lsa.umich.edu/ocbaxtersagart/wp-content/uploads/sites/1415/2025/03/BaxterSagartOCbyRadStr2014-09-20.pdf\"],\"outcome\":\"Opened the official project description and reconstruction PDF; located the separate 匕 entries on table p. 15 and 比 entries on table p. 70. The official table’s page headers distinguish its table pagination from physical PDF pagination.\"},{\"query\":\"李學勤主編 字源 2012 ISBN 9787552800692 天津古籍出版社 辽宁人民出版社\",\"urls\":[\"https://books.google.com/books/about/%E5%AD%97%E6%BA%90.html?id=xqP9zAEACAAJ\",\"https://ci.nii.ac.jp/ncid/BB13266817\"],\"outcome\":\"Opened the Google Books bibliographic record to verify title, editor, publisher, year, volume, and ISBN. Catalogue metadata identifies the edition but does not support the character interpretation.\"},{\"query\":\"Direct open attempts of official Unicode Unihan records for 比, 匕, 人\",\"urls\":[\"https://www.unicode.org/cgi-bin/GetUnihanData.pl?codepoint=6BD4\",\"https://www.unicode.org/cgi-bin/GetUnihanData.pl?codepoint=5315\",\"https://www.unicode.org/cgi-bin/GetUnihanData.pl?codepoint=4EBA\"],\"outcome\":\"All three official per-character pages were inaccessible through the browser.\"},{\"query\":\"Open CUHK character entry for 比\",\"urls\":[\"https://humanum.arts.cuhk.edu.hk/Lexis/lexi-mf/search.php?word=%E6%AF%94\"],\"outcome\":\"Opened the entry and inspected its graph analysis, report of early uses, and cited attributions.\"}],\"gaps\":[\"Prior evidence IDs X-9e0d620aa1b5b37f055d and X-a0878061d8b2ddca7af1 have inaccurate Baxter–Sagart page locators. The 匕 entries appear on table p. 15 (physical PDF p. 17); the 比 entries appear on table p. 70 (physical PDF p. 72). Retire these locator-bound records and use the two fresh page-specific table records above. Other supplied Baxter–Sagart records without these erroneous page locators were checked against the entries and did not show a transcription discrepancy.\",\"Prior evidence IDs X-d97900d69eb3aaabaa7e and X-6ca2e73762d1840ebd36 should not support a current Mandarin sound comparison in the article: the full local Unihan file cited by those records is not present in this checkout, the tracked HSK extract has a 比 row but no 匕 row, and official Unicode pages were inaccessible. Fresh current-reading evidence for both characters remains outstanding.\",\"No unresolved scan or printed-identity issue was found on the inspected 字源 pages 737–739 (printed pp. 724–726). The 比 passage on PDF p. 738 / printed p. 725 and the neighboring 匕 entry on PDF p. 737 / printed p. 724 match the provisional OCR at the checked headwords and claims; p. 739 / printed p. 726 begins 北部 and does not continue 比. The prior passage records X-92736f9167e6c3352478, X-5a2134fdcf1818c1cffa, and X-13c3b0b2eee65a8f5c54 were rechecked and no correction or retirement is indicated.\",\"The early oracle-bone and bronze specimens were not individually inspected in this research pass. The book’s two-匕 analysis and the person-form accounts remain attributed, competing interpretations; the scan sequence alone does not settle the signs’ identity or referent.\",\"The cited book’s semantic proposals are not a dated chronology. The exact relationship between the Shang use and adjacency, association, assistance, and comparison remains unresolved; the phrase 王比望乘 has competing readings in the inspected scholarship.\"]}"}}
